-- title:
--   Owned solve buffers and pending recursive queue records
-- statement:
--   This module supplies the owned buffer and intermediate-memory interfaces for sparse exact solves and touched-vertex queue refresh. Its records describe enumerations, right-hand sides, answer buffers, index epochs, pending queue coverage, and memory frames. The constructor and transport APIs express preservation of these structural records; they do not assume algorithmic accuracy, termination, or a desired work bound. These interfaces support independent verification of numeric assembly, exact-solve invocation, and restoration of valid recursive keys.
-- source:
--   Li, Xu, Yang, Zhou, Nearly optimal Personalized PageRank computation, STOC 2027 submission #884, https://github.com/sigact-stoc/stoc2027/releases/download/papers-1/884.pdf, Algorithms 6–9, pp.14–22; sparse buffer and memory-frame realization in the charged exact-SDDM local-machine model.

